<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">EN_ULT en_English_ltr Fri Feb 21 2020 15:49:36 GMT-0500 (EST) tc</book>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">2 Thessolonians</para>
  <para style="toc1">Paul ne Thessaloniame Dage Raukegai Laisiu Kenabe</para>
  <para style="toc2">Thessaloniame Kanabe</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 The.</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Thessalonians</para>
  <para style="mt">Paul ne Thessaloniame Dage Raukegai Laisiu Kenabe</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">Thessaloniame kenabe de laisiu keraibe cai pekei kiee kemakge cai Corinth gade langgai. Midung ge Paul de ci maudi eh Jisu kelwagwang bizie delie di. Kesang, penui matei tadi nah penui Jisu de kwa bamdi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paul Thessaloniame dage (AD 51-52 dau) raugaidai nah penui dage Jisu pia pekenabe kegwang dainzwa ziebi raugai. Pa penuide Jisu gwang kemakne matei nribam lulo nah penui ting teu cisüt lulo rang nsung kegai taigai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io1">Paul pelung kepang (1:1-12)</para>
  <para style="io1">Rampaube gwang kera ting rehi (2:1-17)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ledeu kemting nah Samlam ge (3:1-18)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="s">Keraisam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Paul, Silvanus, nah Timothy, ne anui Peibe Tinggwang nah Rampaube Jisu Khrista gade Thessalonia namdi ga ngqwabe dage laisiu raukegai. <verse eid="2TH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Anui Peibe Tinggwang nah Rampaube Jisu Khrista gade peu ngaugia nah lungciep nnuida bam kelube tei lulo.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kenggai nah kekie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />Sinamedung, anui nnui ziemne Tinggwang de twabam mui kera anui nsam da. Aide au petau, kedanemene nnui kenlum yi reu reu kebamne nah nnui keheibe de ket ket de kereku reu reu kebamne. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Cine anui nnui ha Tinggwang gu ngqwakidung kakga hegie süt eh rang bamla. Mine nnuide tei keherei kecu leuga nnui lungtie nah nnui kenlum bamkelu hade anui rang bamla. Nah nnui keherei kecu lia kelude anui rang bamla. <verse eid="2TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Aide Tinggwang tutiak au mzui lie kecu liakegai geda, nah aide ziemne nnui Tinggwang hegwangram ga gwanglu kebuime teilu zie, cide ziemne nnui keherei bam. <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Tinggwang au mzui: Pa nnuide tei keherei kelame ziehi keherei le tei pwapeu zie, <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />nah nnui, anuide ngngwa keherei kelame de kerelui peu zie. Pa aide Rampaube Jisu tinggim gade pe gwame kengkiengme de ngngwalwe kegwangdau teizie. <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />Pa miheu gade Tinggwang de ci kemakme de nah anui Rampaube Jisu samliakeyi de mzai kemakme de saja peu zie. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />Rampaube dwade nah pe kengkieng kendu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pe kengkieng kendu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pa kegwang dau penui pe kendu kedi de liagai kelak, de de rang bam. </char></note> gade teuntsam lwe penuide penli kegah kekap saja peuzie. <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />Pe kemcime dade kendu ngaulu kera nah nlumkelume peciakne ngau eh penui macang kerane pa caili kegwang benai, pa aide tei zie. Kedanemene anui nnui dage zierang tei kegaide nlumlu delu. <verse eid="2TH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Aide ziemne anui nnui ziemne kiebam muila, anui Tinggwang nnuide qugai kelu ga luulu kebuime teilu kerane. Peu pe kengkieng gade ma keyibe hengin kela leune nah kenlum ta pelane teicang kelube teilo anui kiela. <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />Anui Tinggwang nah Rampaube Jisu Khrista ngaugia de ziemne, peu nnuide Rampaube Jisu zi tei ndulu kerane, nah pe ziemne nnuide ndulu kerane anui ma aidungde kiela.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Hezaikegah minabe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Sinamedung, anui Rampaube Jisu Khrista caili kegwang ha nah anui gwang ngkwa eh pecu nzang bamdi kera hade anui nnui dade kiela, <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />Rampaube caili kegwang tingba gwang bam dida de rabe gade, mede samlia gade, mede laisiu anui dade gwanglie kecu gade kerang dene nnui kecet kebwakdi mede nnui lung keherei diso. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Peu migede de ma kehei gade nnuide cwa diso. Kedanemene ma kehebwak, nah hezai mzai kemakbe, kengkap nabe de mi miakngau tei gwang kemakdwa, cipau tingba de gwang laklu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa kehegwa laisiudung ga, </char><char style="fqa">nah mina kemaube de liagaidi, de eh peila.</char> </note> <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />Pa renia cuh zie nah Tinggwang lie qukelame de recakela leu reu pekatei pecu kailu zie. Ciciu eh, pa Tinggwang kerecaki ga lütbam zie nah pa pekatei pecu Tinggwang lie zie. <verse eid="2TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Ih nnuide ngngwa kebamdau aidungde peciakne nnui dage rang kebeude nnui nsung meni? <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Nah pecu peu peting siakdau mi miakngau tei gwanglu kerane, cu pecu dai ne kaam pwa bambi kecu nnui cibam. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Kedanemene hezaikegah kengkim de heta tei cuhbam dida, dede cu cide kaam pwa kebambe de teu mpetdi kemaktane pa tei jüja bamzie. <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Pecai hezai mzai kemakpe de keuliagai zie, pecu Rampaube Jisu pe mui gade kepet cui dele teitset dizie nah pa caili kegwang dau pe kendu dele pecu teingkap dizie. <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Hezai mzai kemakpe kegwang au Satan bata, kengkieng leune, nah marehidung, nah kesang kemak miswakegah batadung gade zie, <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />nah masangkemak mide kecwa leune gade zie. Mina aidungde gah dizeu kedanemene penuide kelilu kera ziemne keku kesangbe luulu kemakne. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Aide ziemne Tinggwang penui dage heta petaukemak ge langgai, ciciu eh peu penuide kenretpe nlumlu kerane.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kenretpe nlumlu kerane: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide pekie cai, penui kesangbe hung kemakne Tinggwang penui de peu kenretpe nlum kera kaizeudi. </char></note> <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />Iciu eh mileune, kesangbe de nlum kemakme dede masang kemakbe de pesui kelame de mmau dizie,.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sap ntiplu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Rampaube ne kukela sinamedung, anui nnui ziemne Tinggwang de twabam mui kera anui zieda. Kedanemene Tinggwang nnuide Kemci Rabe ne tei mcikelu gade nah kesangbe nlum kelu gade nnuide kedet pwa kelikelu tsibui raitube tei kelune.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kedabe laisiu kesa, </char><char style="fqa">Kedanemene Tinggwang nnuide raitu gade kelikelu ziemne kedetlu, de peila</char> </note> <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Pa anui samliakeyi gade nnuide aika ge qugai luda, iciu eh peu nnuide anui Rampaube Jisu Khrista kendu de ngaulu kerane. <verse eid="2TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Cine, sinamedung, sap ntiplu nah sam gade mede anui laisiu raukegai gade anui nnuide ledeu kebeu kesangbe de kerak ntip pwa bamlu.<verse eid="2TH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Cu peu anui Rampaube Jisu Khrista, nah anui Peibe Tinggwang, anuide ku kelabe nah ngaugia gade anuide kelungta helungtaukemla nah keregui keyi kepeube de, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />nnui heta keyi ketei nah sam keyi kerang leune ga nnui lung taumla nah nnui mlung teingkuu beu kelube tei lulo.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s">Kie bamlo kekie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Kamtube, sinamedung, Rampaube sam depeu, nnuida nzwa eh rangrwa zette lu nah peu hetwa punglu kerane anui ziemne kielu. <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />Anuide kenlienme nah mina kesiame dade kelilu kerane kielu, kedanemene mina peciakne da kenlum bam kap melu. <verse eid="2TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Dede Rampaube au masang, pa nnuide tei ngkieng beu nah kesia gade nnuide gum beuzie. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Dede anui aja kai kebeudung, nnui tei bam nah tei jüja lalu kera Rampaube gade anui nnui da kekuu bam. <verse eid="2TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Dede peu Rampaube de nnui lung teipwa Tinggwang keku nah Khrista dade kegwang liakelu gage ngngwa gai kelube tei lulo.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kenghet de mmau kegaisam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Cu sinamedung, nnui siname kenghet teilung lunghkela nah anui dade hezaidung ngaukelu ga nzui eh lungh gailu kemak leune dade mbai dilu lo anui Rampaube Jisu Khrista zi gade nnui dage aja kaila. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Kedanemene nnui anui zai relikecu de petau lie eh nnuikatei cibam, kedanemene anui nnui kakga kelungh dau samzai tei eh lungh kecune. <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />Anui mige gu ketyeipok de pemi tei mene tyei ma. Meliene, anui heta kerütdung tei nah rei eh tingmui tingba heta tei, iciu eh anui migede de tei nrütdi melu kerane. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Anui aide tei kecu anui nzeu kegah ne ma, dede anui nnuide saukelia ge teilu kerane, iciu eh nnui anui zai relilu kerane. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Kedanemene kesang, anui nnuide ngngwa kebam dau, anui nnuide sam aide aja kaibeu dida, “Magade mige makam teineu meliecai, peu pecu matyei so.” <verse eid="2TH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Kedanemene anui nnui kakga midungge kenghet teilung lungh nah matei mene kedame ta kebwak kebam siu kecune. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Cu cipaume dungde peu nlei mene penui mata teilu nah penuikatei penui pok hi tyei lulo de Rampaube Jisu Khrista zi gade aja kai eh kecung gaila. <verse eid="2TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Dede nnui, sinamedung, nnui ma petaube ketei ga leu diso. <verse eid="2TH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Dede magade mige anui sam laisiu aide ga kebamde mzairau dicai, pecu cilu nah pecu ngngwa magede teiso, iciu eh pecu peu ngngamlu kerane. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Dede pecu ngauraume ge nzwa cet diso, dede pecu siname ge nzwa rang mriak beulu.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kelumkegai kekambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Cu peu Lungciep Rampaube de nnuide kehei daude nah kehei lampui gade lungciep peu kelube tei lulo. Rampaube depeu nnui pelane de ngngwa la lulo. <verse eid="2TH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Aide Ih kelum kegai, Paul, akatei a bale rau gaila,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Akatei a bale raugai la: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Cide, aipau giak kegai de au Paul laisiu kesang lie kecu keulia kegai ge.</char></note> cide a laisiu leune gage giak kegai ge. Ih ainzwa raula. <verse eid="2TH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Anui Rampaube Jisu Khrista ngaugia depeu nnui pelane da bam kelube tei lulo.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>